  "methodology": "Price-to-rent, property tax, and buying and selling costs are the September 2026 Global Property Guide figures for an owner-occupied home across the IMF 2025 top-20 economies by nominal GDP. Property tax is already an effective rate on market value, including taxes originally charged on rent. South Korea price-to-rent uses Numbeo 2026 because GPG does not cover Korea. Housing home prices and monthly service charges are curated local-currency mid-market defaults by dwelling type (apartment / townhouse / detached), imported from Data/housing-defaults spreadsheets. Loan term, PMI, maintenance, and insurance baselines are curated owner-occupied defaults. Mortgage rates, rent growth, and home-price changes are filled from official series when the catalog is published.",
